 "equipment_type": "Pressure-dependent VAV zone controller",
 "applies_to": "Schneider Electric SEZ7260 zone controllers (F model with floating damper and AO2, C model) used with SEZ7656 rooftop controllers in pressure-dependent zoning systems.",
 "summary": "The SEZ7260 is the zone (damper) controller of the Schneider Electric SEZ7000 zoning system. It shares a BACnet MS/TP network with its SEZ7656 rooftop controller and exchanges demands, occupancy and outdoor temperature with it on its own, so no BMS bindings are needed. Objects cover room temperature and setpoints, damper position and limits, PI demands sent to the rooftop controller, reheat and output configuration, and CO2 values.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
