  "The guide marks each object for the SEZ7260F and SEZ7260C; objects on only one model say so in the description.",
  "Ranges and state texts come from the guide's range and enumeration tables (matched by type and instance).",
  "Access is from the guide's R / R/W column (R/W shown as W); the guide does not mention a priority array."
 ],
